1
00:00:46,960 --> 00:00:52,320
=The Outlaw=

2
00:00:52,320 --> 00:00:54,040
(This story is entirely fictional.)

3
00:00:54,040 --> 00:00:55,920
(All settings are imaginary.)

4
00:00:55,920 --> 00:00:58,920
=Episode 9=

5
00:01:17,959 --> 00:01:19,599
My husband had business dealings
with Mian in the past.

6
00:01:20,599 --> 00:01:21,239
Compared to you,

7
00:01:22,159 --> 00:01:22,920
he's much more ruthless.

8
00:01:25,799 --> 00:01:27,719
If you want to carry the name of Mian,

9
00:01:28,959 --> 00:01:30,120
you'd better keep me happy.

10
00:01:34,760 --> 00:01:35,599
That's more like it.

11
00:01:37,519 --> 00:01:39,319
I want all the business
of the Songcai family,

12
00:01:40,200 --> 00:01:41,200
and you want revenge,

13
00:01:42,560 --> 00:01:44,120
so we have the same goal.

14
00:01:45,959 --> 00:01:48,239
Mr. Mian, anything you need,

15
00:01:48,239 --> 00:01:49,640
as long as it's within my power,

16
00:01:50,560 --> 00:01:51,400
just say the word.

17
00:01:53,359 --> 00:01:54,159
I'll throw you a bone.

18
00:01:56,239 --> 00:01:57,400
I can tell you

19
00:01:57,400 --> 00:01:59,439
about the shady dealings

20
00:01:59,439 --> 00:02:00,879
between Suowen, Dashan, and Natuo.

21
00:02:05,359 --> 00:02:05,799
Deal.

22
00:02:12,719 --> 00:02:13,879
What was that just now?

23
00:02:18,360 --> 00:02:19,240
I'm talking to you.

24
00:02:24,039 --> 00:02:25,360
Didn't you see it yourself?

25
00:02:26,439 --> 00:02:27,520
I was talking business.

26
00:02:29,360 --> 00:02:30,039
Talking business?

27
00:02:31,199 --> 00:02:31,800
Talking business...

28
00:02:32,360 --> 00:02:33,240
Is that how you do it?

29
00:02:33,240 --> 00:02:34,280
By hugging each other?

30
00:02:35,319 --> 00:02:36,120
What else am I supposed to do?

31
00:02:37,400 --> 00:02:38,879
My husband's bedridden.

32
00:02:39,319 --> 00:02:40,599
My stepson
doesn't take anything seriously.

33
00:02:40,919 --> 00:02:42,080
How's a woman supposed
to do business alone?

34
00:02:43,319 --> 00:02:43,919
You tell me.

35
00:02:45,319 --> 00:02:46,501
This month's books for the mine,

36
00:02:46,502 --> 00:02:47,240
how many times have you checked them?

37
00:02:49,599 --> 00:02:49,919
But...

38
00:02:50,639 --> 00:02:51,639
But he's my enemy.

39
00:02:53,919 --> 00:02:54,479
Enemy?

40
00:02:55,639 --> 00:02:56,439
Don't be ridiculous.

41
00:02:57,400 --> 00:02:58,520
He's Mian.

42
00:02:58,520 --> 00:03:00,240
If I don't win him over,
someone else will.

43
00:03:01,400 --> 00:03:02,319
Our family business...

44
00:03:02,639 --> 00:03:04,319
Do you know how many people
have their eyes on it?

45
00:03:15,479 --> 00:03:16,199
What you just said...

46
00:03:16,960 --> 00:03:17,560
was that true?

47
00:03:21,400 --> 00:03:22,159
Have I ever lied to you?

48
00:03:43,599 --> 00:03:44,400
Whoa.

49
00:03:46,800 --> 00:03:48,000
That's awesome.

50
00:03:50,479 --> 00:03:51,919
This used to be Mian's private estate.

51
00:03:52,919 --> 00:03:53,400
It's yours now.

52
00:03:55,719 --> 00:03:56,039
All right.

53
00:03:57,560 --> 00:03:57,879
Get to work.

54
00:04:08,360 --> 00:04:09,360
Dashan kidnapped these people,

55
00:04:09,800 --> 00:04:11,240
the good-looking ones
went to Grand Royal,

56
00:04:11,240 --> 00:04:12,520
and the strong ones were
kept for his fight ring.

57
00:04:13,800 --> 00:04:15,199
The rest are sold to Suowen

58
00:04:15,199 --> 00:04:16,879
as body packers for his drug trade
or for organ harvesting.

59
00:04:18,120 --> 00:04:19,160
Layla also told me

60
00:04:20,040 --> 00:04:20,948
the three of them

61
00:04:20,949 --> 00:04:22,160
look like partners,

62
00:04:23,319 --> 00:04:24,920
but they keep each other in check.

63
00:04:26,759 --> 00:04:27,160
Right.

64
00:04:28,199 --> 00:04:29,337
Natuo has his eyes on

65
00:04:29,338 --> 00:04:30,639
Suowen's drug business too.

66
00:04:31,319 --> 00:04:32,920
So there must be tension between them.

67
00:04:33,800 --> 00:04:35,048
So we need to

68
00:04:35,049 --> 00:04:36,920
use that against them,

69
00:04:36,920 --> 00:04:38,199
and take them out one by one.

70
00:04:42,560 --> 00:04:43,720
Dashan comes first.

71
00:04:44,480 --> 00:04:46,160
Suowen and Natuo's supply lines

72
00:04:46,160 --> 00:04:46,920
both run through him.

73
00:04:48,480 --> 00:04:49,680
Dashan may be the weakest of them,

74
00:04:50,399 --> 00:04:51,759
but he has deep roots here.

75
00:04:52,720 --> 00:04:53,439
What's your plan to take him down?

76
00:04:55,759 --> 00:04:57,600
He may be Dashan, but I'm Mian.

77
00:04:58,519 --> 00:04:58,959
Right, Ren?

78
00:05:08,040 --> 00:05:08,439
Ren.

79
00:05:09,319 --> 00:05:10,639
The brothers who served under Mian...

80
00:05:11,560 --> 00:05:12,120
get them together for me.

81
00:05:29,800 --> 00:05:30,160
Ren.

82
00:05:32,040 --> 00:05:32,639
Listen.

83
00:05:32,759 --> 00:05:33,399
I know,

84
00:05:33,720 --> 00:05:34,920
you've helped the boss a lot,

85
00:05:36,000 --> 00:05:37,240
but I was with him first.

86
00:05:37,720 --> 00:05:38,150
You know that, right?

87
00:05:38,279 --> 00:05:39,000
So that makes me his number two.

88
00:05:39,519 --> 00:05:40,160
So you can call me

89
00:05:40,639 --> 00:05:41,319
Bro.

90
00:05:43,959 --> 00:05:44,560
You're nuts.

91
00:05:46,199 --> 00:05:47,920
What are you babbling about?

92
00:05:48,319 --> 00:05:49,120
Don't get cocky.

93
00:05:49,120 --> 00:05:49,839
You think I'm scared of you?

94
00:06:04,439 --> 00:06:05,240
Ren.

95
00:06:12,319 --> 00:06:12,839
We're on the same side.

96
00:06:13,639 --> 00:06:14,199
We're all on the same side.

97
00:06:14,560 --> 00:06:15,279
Whoa!

98
00:06:15,560 --> 00:06:16,279
That's awesome!

99
00:06:45,720 --> 00:06:47,160
Hello, Mian!

100
00:07:22,079 --> 00:07:22,560
It's been three years.

101
00:07:23,920 --> 00:07:24,853
I'm back

102
00:07:24,854 --> 00:07:26,720
to set things straight in Langia.

103
00:07:27,600 --> 00:07:28,655
But there are always

104
00:07:28,656 --> 00:07:29,560
people who don't know their place

105
00:07:29,560 --> 00:07:30,720
pushing my limits.

106
00:07:32,319 --> 00:07:33,560
So let them see

107
00:07:34,399 --> 00:07:35,480
what Mian can do.

108
00:07:36,199 --> 00:07:38,319
Send

109
00:07:39,319 --> 00:07:39,920
every last one of them

110
00:07:40,800 --> 00:07:41,560
straight to hell.

111
00:07:43,959 --> 00:07:44,640
Get them!

112
00:07:44,800 --> 00:07:47,560
Get them!

113
00:07:56,800 --> 00:07:58,480
The gangs have been fighting every day.

114
00:07:59,319 --> 00:08:00,639
Now we have to take this back road.

115
00:08:01,959 --> 00:08:02,360
Hey.

116
00:08:02,959 --> 00:08:03,759
Stay sharp.

117
00:08:04,839 --> 00:08:06,119
Some punks have been hitting

118
00:08:06,120 --> 00:08:06,920
our shipments every day.

119
00:08:07,720 --> 00:08:08,829
Boss Suowen is still waiting

120
00:08:08,830 --> 00:08:09,800
for this new batch of body packers.

121
00:08:30,160 --> 00:08:31,399
Finally caught you.

122
00:08:32,360 --> 00:08:33,131
So you're the ones

123
00:08:33,132 --> 00:08:34,159
who've been hitting our shipments.

124
00:08:39,120 --> 00:08:40,080
Filthy Ren?

125
00:08:41,879 --> 00:08:42,559
Mian's men?

126
00:08:43,399 --> 00:08:43,800
Hey.

127
00:08:44,919 --> 00:08:45,399
Punk.

128
00:08:46,600 --> 00:08:48,320
Since you know we're Mian's men,

129
00:08:48,799 --> 00:08:50,559
get down on your knees!
Hands on your heads!

130
00:08:50,840 --> 00:08:52,600
In your dreams.

131
00:08:54,919 --> 00:08:56,480
Boss Dashan, we found the ones
hitting our shipments.

132
00:09:17,519 --> 00:09:18,039
Punk.

133
00:09:18,759 --> 00:09:20,279
Surrender while you still can.

134
00:09:20,960 --> 00:09:22,639
You're the punk.

135
00:09:23,039 --> 00:09:24,039
You want me to surrender?

136
00:09:27,919 --> 00:09:28,960
Go to hell.

137
00:09:33,840 --> 00:09:34,360
Who is it?

138
00:10:00,559 --> 00:10:01,240
It's Mian.

139
00:10:01,240 --> 00:10:02,039
So what if it's Mian?

140
00:10:03,679 --> 00:10:04,879
Anyone who crosses our boss

141
00:10:05,679 --> 00:10:06,759
is as good as dead.

142
00:10:08,320 --> 00:10:08,799
Just three years,

143
00:10:10,240 --> 00:10:10,899
and you already think

144
00:10:10,900 --> 00:10:12,879
Mian's name carries no weight in Langia?

145
00:10:13,919 --> 00:10:14,250
Fine.

146
00:10:15,080 --> 00:10:16,080
You're going to be the message

147
00:10:16,919 --> 00:10:18,519
I send to all of Langia.

148
00:10:20,120 --> 00:10:21,559
You think a few threats

149
00:10:21,559 --> 00:10:22,559
are enough to scare me?

150
00:10:27,120 --> 00:10:27,519
Tujiu.

151
00:10:28,919 --> 00:10:30,279
The first time I met you,

152
00:10:30,279 --> 00:10:31,480
I knew you were one of a kind.

153
00:10:32,559 --> 00:10:33,600
You're loyal

154
00:10:33,600 --> 00:10:34,480
and devoted to your boss.

155
00:10:35,120 --> 00:10:36,879
You think Dashan
really sees you as one of his own?

156
00:10:37,919 --> 00:10:40,600
Hmph! You think I'm scared of you?

157
00:10:55,840 --> 00:10:57,320
Back where I'm from,

158
00:10:58,519 --> 00:10:59,000
we have a saying:

159
00:11:04,919 --> 00:11:06,399
You can't see into a person's heart.

160
00:11:13,919 --> 00:11:14,759
Think it over.

161
00:11:16,240 --> 00:11:16,840
Good news, please.

162
00:11:34,120 --> 00:11:34,440
Drive.

163
00:11:43,559 --> 00:11:43,960
Tujiu.

164
00:11:44,519 --> 00:11:44,900
Boss.

165
00:11:48,120 --> 00:11:48,519
This car...

166
00:11:50,840 --> 00:11:51,400
What's going on?

167
00:11:53,639 --> 00:11:54,279
Boss, they're

168
00:11:55,000 --> 00:11:55,559
Mian's men.

169
00:11:57,320 --> 00:11:57,639
Mian.

170
00:11:58,919 --> 00:11:59,500
Mian.

171
00:12:00,919 --> 00:12:01,399
Mian!

172
00:12:05,440 --> 00:12:05,800
Tujiu.

173
00:12:07,799 --> 00:12:08,159
Tell me.

174
00:12:09,120 --> 00:12:09,799
What did he say to you?

175
00:12:16,600 --> 00:12:17,000
You know

176
00:12:17,559 --> 00:12:18,679
I'm like a brother to you.

177
00:12:20,919 --> 00:12:21,519
What did he say?

178
00:12:25,120 --> 00:12:25,879
What did he say?

179
00:12:41,759 --> 00:12:45,399
It's all right. Come, Tujiu.

180
00:12:47,720 --> 00:12:50,039
Take this shipment!

181
00:12:55,919 --> 00:12:56,240
Oh no!

182
00:13:04,240 --> 00:13:04,600
Fine.

183
00:13:05,120 --> 00:13:05,559
Go.

184
00:13:07,679 --> 00:13:08,080
Dashan.

185
00:13:09,840 --> 00:13:11,279
You're done profiting off

186
00:13:12,120 --> 00:13:12,639
people's misery.

187
00:13:15,960 --> 00:13:16,279
Tujiu.

188
00:13:17,240 --> 00:13:19,279
Do you know how much I lose

189
00:13:19,679 --> 00:13:20,360
when one shipment goes missing?

190
00:13:22,840 --> 00:13:23,240
Losing one shipment

191
00:13:23,399 --> 00:13:24,039
isn't a big deal.

192
00:13:25,159 --> 00:13:26,240
But I can't lose the bond we have.

193
00:13:27,120 --> 00:13:27,960
Right?

194
00:13:30,200 --> 00:13:30,639
Does it hurt?

195
00:13:31,759 --> 00:13:32,300
Tujiu.

196
00:13:33,919 --> 00:13:34,799
How many years have you been with me?

197
00:13:35,399 --> 00:13:35,919
Ten years.

198
00:13:37,200 --> 00:13:37,879
Have I treated you well?

199
00:13:38,519 --> 00:13:38,900
Yes.

200
00:13:39,559 --> 00:13:39,900
Good.

201
00:13:41,600 --> 00:13:42,480
Then explain this.

202
00:13:43,120 --> 00:13:44,120
What exactly happened today?

203
00:13:46,720 --> 00:13:47,840
Don't worry. You have my word.

204
00:13:48,639 --> 00:13:49,399
Tell me what happened today,

205
00:13:49,399 --> 00:13:50,080
and I won't hold it against you.

206
00:13:51,120 --> 00:13:51,960
Boss, you know me.

207
00:13:51,960 --> 00:13:52,440
I...

208
00:13:52,440 --> 00:13:53,240
would never lie to you.

209
00:13:55,879 --> 00:13:56,480
Then why

210
00:13:57,120 --> 00:13:59,200
have my shipments gone missing
three times?

211
00:14:00,840 --> 00:14:01,480
This time I came myself,

212
00:14:02,360 --> 00:14:03,919
and saw you with Mian.

213
00:14:05,200 --> 00:14:06,080
Did you make a deal with him?

214
00:14:06,360 --> 00:14:06,700
No.

215
00:14:06,960 --> 00:14:08,399
Did he pay you off?

216
00:14:08,960 --> 00:14:09,519
I swear, Boss.

217
00:14:09,799 --> 00:14:10,320
You swear?

218
00:14:10,639 --> 00:14:10,960
I swear.

219
00:14:10,960 --> 00:14:11,399
You swear?

220
00:14:11,399 --> 00:14:11,759
I swear.

221
00:14:11,759 --> 00:14:12,320
Swear?

222
00:14:23,120 --> 00:14:23,679
What's this?

223
00:14:25,559 --> 00:14:26,000
I don't know.

224
00:14:26,240 --> 00:14:26,840
You take me for a fool?

225
00:14:27,519 --> 00:14:28,279
I don't even know what that is.

226
00:14:28,279 --> 00:14:28,679
You take me for a fool?

227
00:14:30,200 --> 00:14:31,039
I really don't know, Boss.

228
00:14:31,360 --> 00:14:33,519
Why'd you turn traitor?

229
00:14:33,519 --> 00:14:34,440
Boss, I'm not a traitor.

230
00:14:34,919 --> 00:14:35,799
You have five seconds to explain.

231
00:14:36,120 --> 00:14:36,450
Five.

232
00:14:36,639 --> 00:14:37,840
- Boss, I'd never lie to you.
- Four.

233
00:14:38,120 --> 00:14:38,519
Three.

234
00:14:38,799 --> 00:14:39,300
Fine!

235
00:14:39,600 --> 00:14:40,519
I'll go get Mian right now.

236
00:14:44,360 --> 00:14:45,600
I'll bring him in.

237
00:14:46,559 --> 00:14:46,919
Hurry!

238
00:14:47,679 --> 00:14:48,200
Hurry!

239
00:14:48,919 --> 00:14:49,639
Hurry up!

240
00:14:51,679 --> 00:14:53,080
So you chose to betray me.

241
00:14:53,639 --> 00:14:54,080
Fine.

242
00:14:56,120 --> 00:14:57,000
Get me the club, now.

243
00:14:57,720 --> 00:14:58,320
Bring it!

244
00:15:17,120 --> 00:15:18,120
Listen up.

245
00:15:19,519 --> 00:15:20,320
Anyone who lies to me

246
00:15:22,120 --> 00:15:23,759
dies.

247
00:15:25,320 --> 00:15:28,120
(Police rescued trafficked foreigners)

248
00:15:28,120 --> 00:15:29,759
(on Dawu Mountain last night.)

249
00:15:30,320 --> 00:15:32,519
(Job scams lured most victims.)

250
00:15:33,120 --> 00:15:34,960
(International attention follows.)

251
00:15:35,600 --> 00:15:38,000
(Fugitive Dashan remains wanted.)

252
00:15:38,480 --> 00:15:39,720
(Tips requested.)

253
00:15:39,720 --> 00:15:40,320
(Stay cautious.)

254
00:15:47,000 --> 00:15:48,240
Mona took several victims

255
00:15:48,240 --> 00:15:50,000
back to their embassies,

256
00:15:50,279 --> 00:15:51,320
and that drew a lot of attention.

257
00:15:52,120 --> 00:15:53,879
Otherwise,
knowing how the cops in Langia work,

258
00:15:54,320 --> 00:15:55,445
they'd probably have

259
00:15:55,446 --> 00:15:56,320
buried the whole thing again.

260
00:15:57,919 --> 00:15:58,440
To be fair,

261
00:15:58,919 --> 00:15:59,919
they're in a difficult position too.

262
00:16:00,519 --> 00:16:01,600
But this case

263
00:16:01,600 --> 00:16:02,285
has already damaged

264
00:16:02,286 --> 00:16:03,519
Langia's international reputation.

265
00:16:03,919 --> 00:16:04,970
So they have to

266
00:16:04,971 --> 00:16:06,109
take Dashan down

267
00:16:06,110 --> 00:16:06,679
to give everyone an answer.

268
00:16:08,240 --> 00:16:08,559
Boss.

269
00:16:09,200 --> 00:16:10,639
Police still haven't caught Dashan.

270
00:16:11,240 --> 00:16:12,240
Do you think he's already slipped away?

271
00:16:13,320 --> 00:16:14,320
Dashan is very cunning.

272
00:16:15,720 --> 00:16:16,960
The police won't find him easily.

273
00:16:18,120 --> 00:16:18,919
Where could he be hiding?

274
00:16:23,720 --> 00:16:24,399
The underground fight club.

275
00:16:26,559 --> 00:16:27,474
He's wanted now.

276
00:16:27,475 --> 00:16:29,000
He can only hide in the darkest place.

277
00:16:31,320 --> 00:16:32,600
But all those victims

278
00:16:32,601 --> 00:16:33,720
were trafficked there.

279
00:16:34,440 --> 00:16:35,799
None of them knows
where the underground fight club is.

280
00:16:37,679 --> 00:16:38,559
He'll give himself away.

281
00:16:40,559 --> 00:16:41,759
What about the message
I told you to spread?

282
00:16:42,679 --> 00:16:44,159
It's all over Langia now.

283
00:16:53,279 --> 00:16:54,679
Time to finish them off.

284
00:17:09,560 --> 00:17:10,800
♪Dust rises along the border♪

285
00:17:10,800 --> 00:17:12,120
♪Out here, life and death are routine♪

286
00:17:12,120 --> 00:17:13,480
♪Spent shells fall, last echoes ring♪

287
00:17:13,480 --> 00:17:14,880
♪Friends yesterday, now in battle♪

288
00:17:14,880 --> 00:17:16,240
♪Fate's blade falls, who can stop it?♪

289
00:17:16,240 --> 00:17:17,560
♪Against the tide, I never bow♪

290
00:17:17,560 --> 00:17:18,880
